  "contents": [
    {
      "id": "b6aa9368-43f0-4e7b-8f0f-1605bbb5f672",
      "title": "Escute cada novidade e repare apenas no tom. O foco aqui é sentir se a resposta natural seria de alegria, pena ou espanto.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 1,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "e7129e87-2f7c-4d4a-974b-8dfd795a0a77",
          "textContent": "<p>A primeira novidade costuma puxar uma reação positiva imediata.</p><p><strong>Al final me dieron la beca.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>No fim, me deram a bolsa.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/6828a3fdcd14419992d5197f630700d5_l03b01-noticia-beca.mp3?Expires=1794099581&Signature=W6JTarxLYoM~JrdMdScqVeEVCm~OefuP0FjM8C3lCPnMCHMVsC4bC26NjzEZc5WadUEL9jNb~VCT~ecseCvTtxKJrZKtUczo5Zc1aEMQmLUftD0pTvPMGHuz9ZQZAO-wb4bikuMqli7RIjbWrFB5HgR4y9ZmR~ALsy10z~o4MjN0Qtc0EJoYBFUCGI8LnUoYpogJ0daoPJ2P4hWd8~QRkqJXP4NINuuD~vwIM0I3QreEKBXmuGcmRU65~Y1Wp15bfjSnLSAnXUEwsgJODlfhkeYxg~kJkeXsWJhAUlhjRpnY0PM0-G8uaS580kXhBS29ZxFHRoiZlNNq3wvwn7Sy1A__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "9296365b-e9c5-4934-a068-5ad8303ee547",
          "textContent": "<p>A segunda já aponta para um problema ou plano que deu errado.</p><p><strong>Cancelaron el viaje de mañana.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Cancelaram a viagem de amanhã.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/16fc08e44c8849a6bb1abab031703c5f_l03b01-noticia-viaje-cancelado.mp3?Expires=1794099581&Signature=y4To0vFKm8pkj8BWdLzAOTAZEPNTYEI9o6wX86f~Tt9mawPA8BX81IcI6KSzqFWzOCxpn4IgL-kt5eGRe9F~nbWGKykRcGxK3tDBNAzfsZvqpwHUH2jiJzYTfpXli-nkivj7VGeq13Tdw0eGnWDNwhZWh-CvyctzuIgs8JKVuKmIrnqiWDrzPm5qmH0OoU6dIo0X0jUJcGUq3UpeAi0ENKyN1tkZaCH370~xgPi4OaSuS1SVb5sX8v0uC7BkD1JkR5YcuQyI~EfFjkxxgCoIz37aZ7EaLC5W3cDuR76XODlwfkLA~kKrdQq5lvXW9iCI5mfW81m81aJHjb~E20eJ2A__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "5291033f-5388-438d-984c-e1debfc05e0b",
          "textContent": "<p>A terceira soa mais exagerada e convida a uma reação de espanto.</p><p><strong>El seguro cuesta mil euros al mes.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>O seguro custa mil euros por mês.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/dc01bc545ed54cbcac51da697a4badf8_l03b01-noticia-seguro-caro.mp3?Expires=1794099581&Signature=HO7iWhKM1cvUN6KvqcMxcVrAOItIxWWQQ7O82lk25fwncb3l5h5DwztPmonsntEmByXiSFNMUW4dH-2xGuhP9K9NL3gZu7~Kk56VaDO6F03cKo4rr-QGUmHKb4NepbPiDCp6adM~KdUY36v5f6qRpxiUCPFkSPOaK8N4I-QdKei56MVhHv89U~x2GOLrfrpEDtiy8hI3ChLDNyQTLT0k4oCtNbr~d3B98~ydlJ9cKvGwPgFuagB~cI2uOh8THSlaO7Xp5uKX2GVK0kr-q8eKdy0rkGCN50JOblHMQDfLaLccDbN5P0TGsejh0Un2HqBq9YQD4L-Ya1E4S3XP4kR~LQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "1a960cc3-c994-45fc-b9f4-dd251da84906",
      "title": "Olhe a cena, escute e leia cada reação. Primeiro vem a alegria pela notícia; depois, o apoio direto à outra pessoa.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "96936e38-b727-41f3-a9c4-c044bcbb5127",
          "textContent": "<p>Quando a notícia é claramente boa, a reação pode sair bem curta.</p><p><strong>¡Qué bien!</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Que bom!</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/b71d0f1d44954d6cbcf52a23d3182cf6_l03b02-good-news-friends.png?Expires=1794099581&Signature=yXfckUwsdISM2hdnpsKl6W-PU3PrSvw2m~FfWA9l17gsy~K-ftPbRh7v9HEHSD3wmvRMUOlBbNYX7N8Sqg4pV4TH4Z1X0DQyFzyzU2swjlTEU4PBuM78LeGxe1187UYz4WaZmQdOIlESMdscLGP0ibjjJWLJCYJhi6JVDu963Rp8tlSXHwLqu1F0tMuXrkUWpNmoDtAznL28SgSdRd0RmIm4PAbTVqs4-uL0Ckt48n9aloBeuxWWeCPNgg3kxG2~aZQqImA~bGjw1xeMb2zJb-O7vRL8ED2fImzUZKwSk1X81WTek6wIhnh7UQUs8MKGBhclfDOuRTS6Ba~xZfVwyw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/a172f6cd93434674bbb720bd256744dd_l03b02-que-bien.mp3?Expires=1794099581&Signature=NbRmkWPB~GY1NDJDAFN-VON5LY~uPdNIpw2evkp9Q5ErG8Wct7kyu3sdVCFAsGGy-mC8~wlHiyJebhv~orcQCGfFO7e2ztu1zaxnuGzP7miGjGc9JpzDoSsDEyPBNB8O4Gigu5KN1PrWFZKorVMZG~Jfg-V0jN2Bi333llOdODiSAQKPtY0tQFs4FQtjaabOaBx-erl5Q1LaRlQVusofD8iNYl-eMm7LkoCq0gKTFIhzc8HtwAkUf8mxlzJMANPHb9qzfiyoNN3ZuB3RAwkl~oUTT3EtDvlRFHILQczVkb2vT67KqlKP2T-BnAsnjmAplH78y-SVfed~PRlaydlFCg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "bf6360e3-8d87-4c0e-953a-a8f001f36afa",
          "textContent": "<p>Se a boa notícia é da outra pessoa, a reação pode ficar mais pessoal.</p><p><strong>Me alegro por ti.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Fico feliz por você.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/b71d0f1d44954d6cbcf52a23d3182cf6_l03b02-good-news-friends.png?Expires=1794099581&Signature=yXfckUwsdISM2hdnpsKl6W-PU3PrSvw2m~FfWA9l17gsy~K-ftPbRh7v9HEHSD3wmvRMUOlBbNYX7N8Sqg4pV4TH4Z1X0DQyFzyzU2swjlTEU4PBuM78LeGxe1187UYz4WaZmQdOIlESMdscLGP0ibjjJWLJCYJhi6JVDu963Rp8tlSXHwLqu1F0tMuXrkUWpNmoDtAznL28SgSdRd0RmIm4PAbTVqs4-uL0Ckt48n9aloBeuxWWeCPNgg3kxG2~aZQqImA~bGjw1xeMb2zJb-O7vRL8ED2fImzUZKwSk1X81WTek6wIhnh7UQUs8MKGBhclfDOuRTS6Ba~xZfVwyw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/6a6525d82abc4f2c96dce5f2d0ab9651_l03b02-me-alegro-por-ti.mp3?Expires=1794099581&Signature=sCxYB0LXyL-FdXiG~6DQgW6leRfiUhAO9u63HnYypaEzjy-FbtjLgEdkKiJ5cxUIzyeX~TPlZ6dgaZplQB3QjPJxCVyipJAt3CnydLGn5n3jrNT3Njop7EC0tUCxfBziupQlR8cKEbrPHUM3IEgCGYz4ZiUrSCY0PwGNoi7Zc1G0eJu4iB~XcPgftf9nrN74avcSbPFmbeRGom15u5hOf28rCR74AoJERyLGr2ntxLfZYZaV4MSVa-WQs3LPjiRmYcWbkZHvJOo--uKNPvBM-2qaQgJcWLa0RNvComL8BBb8WfWtpK4U6mfisf4QIaInZEwOvXkPEs1zr1LO4-0Shg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
