    {
      "id": "746215ba-7a1c-408e-8fd6-02dc870c0d77",
      "title": "Olhe a cena, escute e leia cada fórmula. Uma responde a um problema real; a outra a algo exagerado ou difícil de acreditar.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 3,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "a9bceedd-3a13-4840-8d00-a11b26f98b96",
          "textContent": "<p>Quando a notícia atrapalha um plano ou traz um problema, a reação pode ser direta.</p><p><strong>¡Qué mal!</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Que ruim! / Que pena!</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/46578950520845f2995205fd6c4bf04d_l03b03-cancelled-trip.png?Expires=1794099581&Signature=LlbwBgi8Uu7h2tUYQl6MnYxgGwsU60Eo0DNzbK3WgLn-syWJ8fEk5dIbfSmHHQHuStEjIbw51MiMkUAeWaedeb6BW-oQPAbJlE-qAHAXZgzOtRVKFiHOFFRHgIDk5QK7PJyBwFLoVY6hJzDFsD2xMjDFBsmZz7MF7qH18nON439ZL264OTICFUyO754dKRSlQnhPTrtuJblHXbd0-DEBl7RPdBqEMivGTuUEzguVYdKAB~l1y2MRcB7avJLVteZIVPaqn~zlL0y8TI2INI8IFSN5avVzkq6R4NaNfUgLVKynMJUzTkrS2r9TZQSgtzH83BtCjy~4Gy7RVJy2aIxJmw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/a71726bc1813462bb1c80cff8624e876_l03b03-que-mal.mp3?Expires=1794099581&Signature=Htjs13I~tFw1B5tuZ~Co6TBigh0rd-LSvDRdKkZazPXTJdUm0jhFGx3wYyyD-2Z8j9JwAYBUhLfYqOyO9KuN44EO4ZfT5HaddpLi6XlQH~qb-vaqXUjhnFJ~kDzembyBn1RlTcXKvnUoIXNZaDXnhj7jgOIC1-p0NH9ZWDNvOzU-Hsfn4FcjhS~4Ft1e6hIoAF3x8GI6Ub2Sp~LY7N4~dIez-OcJuP342CxHZWss4~f78LF~vsCHeFftizDgJwHpCB-LI6b8U8zqzKFLHPBH1XxvLJe05j3v2I5UFVYVsmLGhpUSN7Gweq1hgPk98drwn6dU6x994ntG~3UZjF-MAw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "a79c5bd3-78d5-45c2-bcfd-07d190156f98",
          "textContent": "<p>Quando o preço ou a situação parece absurda, o tom muda para espanto.</p><p><strong>¡Qué locura!</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Que loucura!</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/1d52e58bbf4748c6861d1488dc95bb3b_l03b03-shocking-bill.png?Expires=1794099581&Signature=1V1I4astxryUdoqWHYUuR4buYTAAMwlOsZrEdHN7Vos1L2OIrVzeVRvrBrulO4n7Vgw-2NGPY5VzUl-8WYw09NeXLvJP55bke9NR58fY43hYKR3LykFIi9TspBjFlMiV68bjZbOiqYW-5IlqNCUaGGqB5Z2OK8jW~1ikRJC2kmigvTA4IRpeRGPLE04lm7XlPanaOux2D5l14lSDHma0Ku-P2ooUQDY1vv5geB~8Fk33WdOsMRqbginpOyWH5Sbz3ffBmMA21yU9De5oJkqNh7ekwHyEqJXpR6PCP2j-VHFgm0-MYgudqmEVMVX1Z6YhHkkEEsRq23L0otYgkClOew__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/cb735a426a5a4a239fc47cbdb7a30313_l03b03-que-locura.mp3?Expires=1794099581&Signature=kNXvfRXzCGsxkT~Dx3XahDX1Yw8Y~nxEHsM4kfF-nJ~Jk3ynhWEu7fLa8qvPKauCr6te5xbjLFic95zRo~20XQ2ly6m2ir9IAysTNGWDPEPkpG69T0kpE13f7yiPE~gJyj8Xa1vc6dSM5g49gWR0ws43P4ggutqp36nINoMbVVhE267vlfl8P1UCi2djw~tCjywhPp99~nQIxYHWqwdoUg4gemwvzoEmnxmaBB8m3pkazA8HOhL7tSKnJft-bIetXkIDHIx1qM9BjEBPBJDIKmtvReAFQjrFkvxSQopOle24B7lf9TYtP6ukgikZ1Cvu5uP29~g0d0CbFvbkqDiFgw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "440a4bef-16b1-48eb-8523-61f1a3037111",
      "title": "Leia a nota e observe como a mesma expressão serve para surpresa ou incredulidade, dependendo do que vem depois.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "d32d7e73-ede2-43b2-b753-0fbfe33bbb95",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>¿Qué me dices?</strong></p><p>Em português, costuma soar como <strong>Sério?</strong> ou <strong>Como assim?</strong></p><p>A reação entra antes de dizer se a notícia é boa, ruim ou absurda.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/f404f4d8edbb440ab1d7fa8d47ee3fb9_l03b04-que-me-dices.mp3?Expires=1794099581&Signature=MhOGTkEUQ65MohdriSXRrIthhHcIdJGfyqGFuo8e-QALdfm2GdwbCl7o-CAfB-ZQIktvTYwGN9wyg3R3uJymGuREHXkNN0wePiKjUoHea0dpWxHLxSqFD3L8gKbUPx7hBf7rryYdX8dEDnks3CZLQOwlWfodEJ0CsgKeROaZWkcUuX~dPUbq66-NEpjIai0oiDENin1Vx1e8d9HRe51EPsoXBwOfRyOAAaggbi7~oKIwnkJ6nFQ1dYm1m-tfkWs2djvQQFYwxRlXNeZ2O3jyLMpg6tsMd-6ZOIXFdbYnhcDNVmiFh-tiTrZkV4GhimDBs26J7KoGGeCyEKClDrbXpw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "c33aa198-09eb-400a-923d-5b8429e8f7e5",
          "textContent": "<p>Depois disso, o contexto faz o resto.</p><p><strong>¿Qué me dices? No sabía que ya te mudabas.</strong></p><p><strong>¿Qué me dices? ¿Tanto cuesta?</strong></p><p>Nas duas linhas há surpresa, mas a segunda soa mais incrédula.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "26f8698d-996d-492d-a266-c1e924fc1e64",
      "title": "Reações no momento da notícia",
      "description": "<p>Cada troca tem só dois turnos para deixar visível o encaixe entre a novidade e a reação imediata.</p>",
      "contentType": 7,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [],
      "dialogue_bubbles": [
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Al final me dieron la beca.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">No fim, me deram a bolsa.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/6828a3fdcd14419992d5197f630700d5_l03b01-noticia-beca.mp3?Expires=1794099581&Signature=W6JTarxLYoM~JrdMdScqVeEVCm~OefuP0FjM8C3lCPnMCHMVsC4bC26NjzEZc5WadUEL9jNb~VCT~ecseCvTtxKJrZKtUczo5Zc1aEMQmLUftD0pTvPMGHuz9ZQZAO-wb4bikuMqli7RIjbWrFB5HgR4y9ZmR~ALsy10z~o4MjN0Qtc0EJoYBFUCGI8LnUoYpogJ0daoPJ2P4hWd8~QRkqJXP4NINuuD~vwIM0I3QreEKBXmuGcmRU65~Y1Wp15bfjSnLSAnXUEwsgJODlfhkeYxg~kJkeXsWJhAUlhjRpnY0PM0-G8uaS580kXhBS29ZxFHRoiZlNNq3wvwn7Sy1A__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">¡Qué bien! Me alegro por ti.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Que bom! Fico feliz por você.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/8a274c3409f64f1183d61dcb72263de6_l03b05-linea-02.mp3?Expires=1794099581&Signature=Q4OYHt1Mt05qHScFgn3eHBUAlySDYv9zg2vdN66aejSJ-10edkEr73dvBZpbL3UQKMnAUNT8jMIJlLT3dqaF7t7talhNw5Rjq~qR71LCbEJkVfTPG4cLQhfHaifBTjf6WfAZLSQyFUmJ-jtbWE6KyFxrjZXc8hXaL1G114Rlgr8ahQH7v0HHT2mwQHTxfGbsnLLh-nuCNNwnxGz-~omMQ74GG0brYbxZ-y004ncfGLWdp-irE7nLLgaSFGrzd4slerStps~POo2d70e0pwvY8uz9m-~P6yKr2Y3-Zi74HDS6IzJLD1i-HHRB6HbKTHcuubMYpOUUmQTAHjK2HEWPrA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Cancelaron el viaje de mañana.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Cancelaram a viagem de amanhã.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/16fc08e44c8849a6bb1abab031703c5f_l03b01-noticia-viaje-cancelado.mp3?Expires=1794099581&Signature=y4To0vFKm8pkj8BWdLzAOTAZEPNTYEI9o6wX86f~Tt9mawPA8BX81IcI6KSzqFWzOCxpn4IgL-kt5eGRe9F~nbWGKykRcGxK3tDBNAzfsZvqpwHUH2jiJzYTfpXli-nkivj7VGeq13Tdw0eGnWDNwhZWh-CvyctzuIgs8JKVuKmIrnqiWDrzPm5qmH0OoU6dIo0X0jUJcGUq3UpeAi0ENKyN1tkZaCH370~xgPi4OaSuS1SVb5sX8v0uC7BkD1JkR5YcuQyI~EfFjkxxgCoIz37aZ7EaLC5W3cDuR76XODlwfkLA~kKrdQq5lvXW9iCI5mfW81m81aJHjb~E20eJ2A__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">¡Qué mal! ¿Qué me dices?</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Que ruim! Sério?</div>\n</div>",
